<h1>Export / import progress</h1>
<p class="muted">There is no backend and no account. Your review schedule, task attempts and time totals live in this
browser's <code>localStorage</code> — which a cleared cache, a private window, or a different device will not have.
Export after any session you would mind losing.</p>
